{"id": "33520", "title": "游侠录", "author": "古龙", "category": "文学名著", "count": 8, "available": 8, "cover": "files/article/image/33/33520/33520s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/33/33520.htm", "intro": "夕阳西坠，古道苍茫——\r\n\r\n黄土高原被这深秋的晚风吹得几乎变成了一片混饨，你眼力若不是特别的敏锐，你甚至很难看见对面走来的人影。", "base": "files/article/html/33/33520", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一章　恩怨分明", "file": "2127018.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第二章　风云际会", "file": "2127019.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第三章　千蛇之会", "file": "2127020.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第四章　八方风雨", "file": "2127021.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第五章　云龙入云", "file": "2127022.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第六章　峰回路转", "file": "2127023.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第七章　急转直下", "file": "2127024.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第八章　望穿秋水", "file": "2127025.html", "available": true}]}